    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        151.91542053222656,
        399.0928649902344,
        165.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "partners involved in developing guidelines or advising ministries of health. They can",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        164.91539001464844,
        387.23284912109375,
        178.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "also be used as a resource in medical training institutions in pre-service training.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        188.462890625,
        251.6129150390625,
        201.65188598632812
      ],
      "text": "1.2\t Objectives of the recommendations",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        205.08860778808594,
        396.8529052734375,
        218.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "These recommendations are part of a series that will be used to update several guide­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        218.08860778808594,
        399.0928955078125,
        231.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "lines and tools for clinical management of common childhood illnesses at health",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        231.08860778808594,
        268.77294921875,
        244.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "facilities at all levels of care. The main objectives are:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
